                   "text":  "{=bLTkig9T}The Nords live in the cold lands beyond the Byalic Sea. From their ancestral homes in the fjords of the Nordvyg, they have migrated west to the island of Beinland and east to the dark forests of the Jumne river. They grow what food they can in the rocky soils of their homeland, but their wealth comes from the sea - from walrus ivory, from whale oil, and from the raiding longships they send forth to harry the peoples of the south. ",
